    "body": "Depends on #89.\n\nThere are services and ruby gems that just push an `em.yml` file through Google Translate into whatever language we want. That's probably most feasible for us, but I'd at least want someone to proofread everything before we push it.\n\nAs for language choice, I think we ought to take a look at Google Analytics.\n",
